From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erik Bourget <erik@ebourget.net>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 16:38:43 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: cpu: apple,t8140-cpuidle: Add t8132 compatible

The T8132 (M4) idles like the T6040 and T8140: iBoot locks CYC_OVRD,
and a plain WFI already lets the hardware power-gate an idle core. Add
"apple,t8132-cpuidle" to select the same driver behaviour.

Signed-off-by: Erik Bourget <erik@ebourget.net>

(cherry picked from commit 01067b592bf30c25d2689ab25a6b7bf793902e6d)
[J604: conflict resolved by taking the upstream file. Our base lacks the
 T6040 binding commit 474e2bc3ed, so the upstream enum also brings
 apple,t6041-cpuidle, which cpuidle-apple.c in this tree already matches.]
---
 .../bindings/cpu/apple,t8140-cpuidle.yaml         | 15 +++++++++------
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/cpu/apple,t8140-cpuidle.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/cpu/apple,t8140-cpuidle.yaml
index 7d4f9cdbc9..9ffa89ece4 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/cpu/apple,t8140-cpuidle.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/cpu/apple,t8140-cpuidle.yaml
@@ -4,23 +4,26 @@
 $id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/cpu/apple,t8140-cpuidle.yaml#
 $schema: http://devicetree.org/meta-schemas/core.yaml#
 
-title: Apple T8140 CPU idle controller
+title: Apple T6040, T8132 and T8140 CPU idle controller
 
 maintainers:
   - Ryan Murray <ryan@aurorasilicon.org>
 
 description:
-  Selects the Apple CPU idle driver on T8140 systems. On this SoC the
-  hardware decides when an idle core is power-gated after WFI; software
-  cannot request core or cluster power-down, so WFI is the only idle
-  state.
+  Selects the Apple CPU idle driver on T6040, T8132 and T8140 systems. On these
+  SoCs the hardware decides when an idle core is power-gated after WFI;
+  software cannot request core or cluster power-down, so WFI is the only
+  idle state.
 
 properties:
   $nodename:
     const: cpuidle
 
   compatible:
-    const: apple,t8140-cpuidle
+    enum:
+      - apple,t6041-cpuidle
+      - apple,t8132-cpuidle
+      - apple,t8140-cpuidle
 
 required:
   - compatible
